The most powerful beast of all, the Dragon exceeds all
others. An elite Monk can focus the power beyond human
comprehension to become a perfect machine.
 
This form unlocks several powers which can ONLY be used
while in the form of the Dragon.

These powers are: |GKBAid|YK0, |GKBDragon Hurl|YK0, |GKBDragon Fear|YK0, |GKBDragon Kick|YK0
and |GKBDragon Scale|YK0.
